#lang r7rs
;; A continuation captured on a worker thread and re-entered there, three
;; times (jit-r7rs-callcc-reads-unknown-tag-after-per-thread-dynenv).  On
;; glibc a thread's TCB and static TLS sit at the top of its stack mapping,
;; so an image measured to that top rewound the thread's thread-locals on
;; every re-entry -- among them the value the re-entry delivers, which lives
;; in tur_r7rs_dyn: `<: not a number #<unknown>`.  Under `tur jit` the whole
;; program runs on such a thread.
(import (scheme base) (scheme write) (reentrywork) (turmeric reentrycrew))
(run-worker)
(write (worker-answer)) (newline)
